A24%3A58.102Z\",\"imageAlt\":\"Suzlon wins its maiden 200 MW wind energy order from Ayana Renewable Power\",\"href\":\"/media/press/press-releases/suzlon-wins-its-maiden-200-mw-wind-energy-order-from-ayana-renewable-power/\",\"date\":\"8 Sept 2026\"},{\"id\":\"usk40u8ppg8kpdmtxrqrghcf\",\"title\":\"Suzlon and Torrent Partnership grows to over 1.3 GW with a new 250 MW wind order\",\"description\":\"Suzlon Torrent partnership now stands at 1,306 MW with this sixth order; 76 flagship S144 (3.3 MW) WTGs; over 1.1 GW of new orders in FY27\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.suzlon.com/uploads/Torrent_press_release_image_fede8e1693.webp?v=2026-09-23T12%3A34%3A02.029Z\",\"imageAlt\":\"Suzlon and Torrent Partnership grows to over 1.3 GW with a new 250 MW wind order\",\"href\":\"/media/press/press-releases/suzlon-and-torrent-partnership-grows-to-over-1-3-gw-with-a-new-250-mw-wind-order/\",\"date\":\"25 Aug 2026\"},{\"id\":\"gab9fu2p4etw6aee2q3ojukj\",\"title\":\"AP Government and Suzlon break ground for 1,325 MW wind projects in Ananthapuramu; unlock 10,500 crores investment and create 1,600 green jobs\",\"description\":\"Landmark partnership with the Government of Andhra Pradesh; 10,500 crores investment, 1,600 green jobs, and four production lines at the Ananthapuramu blade facility\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.suzlon.com/uploads/Picture1_608a985fea.webp?v=2026-09-23T12%3A36%3A01.065Z\",\"imageAlt\":\"AP Government and Suzlon break ground for 1,325 MW wind projects in Ananthapuramu; unlock 10,500 crores investment and create 1,600 green jobs\",\"href\":\"/media/press/press-releases/ap-government-and-suzlon-break-ground-for-1-325-mw-wind-projects-in-ananthapuramu-unlock-10-500-crores-investment-and-create-1-600-green-jobs/\",\"date\":\"25 Aug 2026\"},{\"id\":\"lexw5htf6aho0mnkm4s2v6rh\",\"title\":\"Suzlon begins FY27 strong with 23% YoY revenue growth and highest-ever Q1 deliveries\",\"description\":\"Highest-ever Q1 deliveries at 506 MW (+14% YoY); ~1 GW new orders including DevCo-led EPC from Tata Power and Waaree Group\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.suzlon.com/uploads/Suzlon_Q3_FY_26_Results_dc5292daad.webp?v=2026-09-23T12%3A30%3A38.488Z\",\"imageAlt\":\"Suzlon begins FY27 strong with 23% YoY revenue growth and highest-ever Q1 deliveries\",\"href\":\"/media/press/press-releases/suzlon-begins-fy-27-strong-with-23-yo-y-revenue-growth-and-highest-ever-q1-deliveries/\",\"date\":\"28 Jul 2026\"},{\"id\":\"y5jopijhmelbtb5raugl6bk7\",\"title\":\"Suzlon powers Waaree Group’s renewable ambitions with a maiden DevCo led 201.6 MW wind order\",\"description\":\"\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.suzlon.com/uploads/suzlon_powers_waaree_972x432_635efc43fd.webp?v=2026-09-23T10%3A38%3A51.240Z\",\"imageAlt\":\"Suzlon powers Waaree Group’s renewable ambitions with a maiden DevCo led 201.6 MW wind order\",\"href\":\"/media/press/press-releases/suzlon-powers-waaree-group-s-renewable-ambitions-with-a-maiden-dev-co-led-201-6-mw-wind-order/\",\"date\":\"23 Jul 2026\"},{\"id\":\"xdyxwat0hhsrvqzabl6qy45g\",\"title\":\"Suzlon's S175 (5.0 MW) marks a strong commercial debut with a 105 MW order from Sunsure Energy\",\"description\":\"First commercial order for India's tallest FDRE-ready wind turbine secured within two weeks of launch; cumulative partnership with Sunsure Energy reaches 400.8 MW\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.suzlon.com/uploads/suzlon_s175_sunsure_order_banner_5ff707390f.webp?v=2026-09-23T12%3A22%3A26.019Z\",\"imageAlt\":\"Suzlon's S175 (5.0 MW) marks a strong commercial debut with a 105 MW order from Sunsure Energy\",\"href\":\"/media/press/press-releases/suzlon-s-s175-5-0-mw-marks-a-strong-commercial-debut-with-a-105-mw-order-from-sunsure-energy/\",\"date\":\"30 Jun 2026\"},{\"id\":\"s50bc2y6ppvg1s3wm4wib3b0\",\"title\":\"Suzlon crosses 1 GW partnership with Tata Power following a DevCo led new 400MW EPC order\",\"description\":\"\",\"imageSrc\":\"https://www.suzlon.com/uploads/suzlon_crosses_1_gw_bad7878462.webp?v=2026-09-23T10%3A45%3A50.476Z\",\"imageAlt\"